{
  "//": [
    "A document, and the Markdown it is written as.",
    "Checked against both writers of that Markdown: `to_markdown` in",
    "`src/richtext.rs` (the export, the Markdown vault, the assistant) and",
    "`ui/src/lib/markdown-copy.ts` (the clipboard), so the two cannot drift.",
    "`readsBack: false` marks Markdown that `from_markdown` does not yet read",
    "back as itself: it reads lists flat, one paragraph to an item."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "headings and paragraphs",
      "doc": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 1
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Tuesday"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "It rained."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 3
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Later"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "markdown": "# Tuesday\n\nIt rained.\n\n### Later"
    },
